                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ") as described in the previous section. For example, let’s say you set the section numbering attribute in the header of your document; however, you don’t want the two sections midway through the document to be numbered. To disable the numbering on these two sections, you’d unset "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "sectnums"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " before the first section you didn’t want numbered and then reset it when you wanted the numbering to start again."
